{"tool_name":"update-fiji","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>The purpose of the ImageJ Updater is to keep you up-to-date with all components of ImageJ (or Fiji), i.e. the macros, scripts, plugins and the core components (libraries) needed by the plugins.</p>\n\n<p>As of 2011, the ImageJ Updater can handle&nbsp;<a href=\"https://imagej.net/Updater#Adding_update_sites\">3rd-party update sites</a>, i.e. anybody can set up their own update site which users can follow.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>The purpose of the ImageJ Updater is to keep you up-to-date with all components of ImageJ (or Fiji), i.e. the macros, scripts, plugins and the core components (libraries) needed by the plugins.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As of 2011, the ImageJ Updater can handle&nbsp;<a href=\"https://imagej.net/Updater#Adding_update_sites\">3rd-party update sites</a>, i.e. anybody can set up their own update site which users can follow.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2019-10-17T16:22:00+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2013-10-11T13:08:41+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4967,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"255696be-8377-461f-92aa-55b8c5f93650","url":"/taxonomy/term/4967"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505206135,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Johannes Schindelin"},{"value":"Curtis Rueden"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"","uri":"https://imagej.net/Updater"}],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":43,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"49079edf-8326-4a2f-b550-21827d985cc7","url":"/user/43"}],"has_function":[],"has_implementation":[{"target_id":4340,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"6077b127-35d6-45a8-ac32-b